Package: portable
Title: A PDF Graphics Device with Embedded Fonts
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Thomas Lin", "Pedersen", , "thomasp85@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5147-4711"))
Description: Provides a modern PDF graphics device that uses systemfonts and
    textshaping for font lookup and text layout (the same font stack as the ragg
    devices) and embeds all used fonts so documents render identically
    everywhere.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
